OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway shut both ways after
OL,4,Alorry hits pedestrian
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motorway in Lancashire has been
OL,7,Fclosed after a collision between a
OL,8,Florry and a pedestrian.
OL,10,FThe M55, which connects Blackpool and
OL,11,FPreston, is shut in both directions and
OL,12,Fis set to remain like that "for some
OL,13,Ftime", Lancashire Constabulary says.
OL,15,FEmergency services were called at 07:55
OL,16,FGMT to the Broughton area of the
OL,17,Fmotorway, with people advised to avoid
OL,18,Fthe area.
OL,20,FPolice have urged anyone who saw the
OL,21,Fcollision to come forward.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
